{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "708b508f-a13a-8c07-b340-f1e07b7af57b",
  "created_at": "2026-02-24T14:28:48-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Isabel Vieira",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Anita Chaudhry",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T14:26:15-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Anita. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T14:26:19-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good afternoon. My name is Isabel Vieira. I am calling with a question about fences, if you would be so kind."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T14:26:27-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, happy to help. What are you thinking of putting up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T14:26:31-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I intend to put a fence around a vegetable garden in the back yard. The deer have been eating everything down to the stems. I am planning black aluminum, four feet tall."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T14:26:42-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And is this a house you own, or are you renting?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T14:26:47-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I rent. The address is 413 Memorial Boulevard, on the Easton's Beach side. The landlord has not objected, but I have not yet asked him formally."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T14:26:56-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good to know. So generally, a fence does need a permit in Newport, and since you're renting, the property owner would need to be on board with it. Is the fence going in the back yard only, not toward the street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T14:27:10-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Only the back yard. It would be well away from the boulevard. Kindly tell me, is there paperwork I must fill out, or is it simply a matter of calling?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T14:27:20-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There's an application, yes. You'd typically give a simple sketch showing where the fence goes and how tall it is, plus the material. The owner usually signs off. I'd get that started before you buy anything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T14:27:32-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I see. That is helpful. And one more matter. Must the finished side of the fence face outward, toward the neighbors?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T14:27:39-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's a common requirement, the finished side facing out. With aluminum picket style it's often the same on both sides, but I'd have the inspector confirm it when the application's reviewed, so you're covered."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T14:27:50-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Kindly forgive me, I must move away from the telephone a moment. My toddler has just discovered the pots cabinet, and there is a great clatter in the kitchen."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T14:28:01-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T14:28:04-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] I am back. All is well. She is wearing a colander."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T14:28:09-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ha, okay. So you can pick up the application at the office, or I can have it emailed or mailed to you. Which would you prefer?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T14:28:18-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mailed, kindly. I do not use email. Shall I give you the address once more?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T14:28:24-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Please, just so I have it right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T14:28:27-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "413 Memorial Boulevard. And my telephone number, in case you need it, is 401-555-0188."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T14:28:32-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 413 Memorial Boulevard. I'll send that out today. Once you've filled it in, bring it back with the owner's signature and we'll go from there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T14:28:41-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you very much, Miss Chaudhry. You have been most kind. Good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T14:28:46-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Take care."
    }
  ],
